<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative' }}>
        <Image src="assets/banner.jpg" style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 60, objectFit: 'cover' }} />
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 15, left: 60, width: 820, fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>残差与损失：只学"差多少"</Text>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 23, left: 900, width: 100, fontSize: 15, color: '#BBD9F2', textAlign: 'right' }}>02 · 方法设计</Text>
    <Image src="assets/logo_bar.png" style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 8, left: 1010, width: 210, height: 44, objectFit: 'contain' }} />

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 72, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 616, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 486, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>为什么精化分支只输出残差</Text>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 18 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E5A9E', width: 34 }}>Ⅰ</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, width: 430 }}>
                        粗估计已给出全局传播结构，残差只需补局部阴影，学习目标更聚焦。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E5A9E', width: 34 }}>Ⅱ</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, width: 430 }}>
                        图操作的 patch 化会破坏像素级对齐，直接回归整图效果反而更差。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E5A9E', width: 34 }}>Ⅲ</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, width: 430 }}>
                        数值更稳：残差量级远小于原图，梯度不会因大数值区间而失衡。
                    </Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ background: '#E8F0FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #123C6E', padding: '14px 18px', marginTop: 22 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        消融里去掉残差，NMSE 从 0.0043 涨到 0.0231，翻了五倍。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 48 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Math latex="L_C=\\frac{1}{H\\times W}\\left\\|y-\\tilde{y}_C\\right\\|_F^{2}" width={250} display={true} color="#123C6E" />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>粗估计 MSE　(10)</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Math latex="L_R=\\frac{1}{H\\times W}\\left\\|y-\\tilde{y}_R\\right\\|_F^{2}" width={250} display={true} color="#123C6E" />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>精化 MSE　(11)</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Math latex="L_{MS}=1-\\mathrm{MS}\\left(\\tilde{y}_R,\\,y\\right)" width={240} display={true} color="#123C6E" />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>多尺度结构相似　(14)</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D8DEE7', width: '100%', marginTop: 18 }} />

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 18 }}>
                    <Math latex="L=\\lambda_1 L_C+\\lambda_2 L_R+\\lambda_3 L_{MS}" width={330} display={true} color="#123C6E" />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>总损失　(15)</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, marginTop: 18 }}>
                    <Box style={{ padding: '10px 18px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D8DEE7', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>λ₁</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#123C6E', marginTop: 2 }}>0.1</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ padding: '10px 18px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D8DEE7', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>λ₂</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#123C6E', marginTop: 2 }}>1</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ padding: '10px 18px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D8DEE7', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>λ₃</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#123C6E', marginTop: 2 }}>1e-4</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 12 }}>
                    三项权重差三个数量级：先保证粗估计可用，再让 SSIM 守住边缘结构。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
